Package: Arachnomicon
Type: Package
Title: Taxonomic Standardization of Spider Species Names Using WSC and GBIF
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Victor",
      family = "Lobato dos Santos",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "vlobatosantos@gmail.com"
    )
Description: 
    Tools to standardize and resolve spider species names using the World Spider
    Catalog (via 'arakno') and GBIF (via 'rgbif'). The package normalizes the
    spelling of names, flags synonyms and outdated combinations, returns the
    currently accepted name, World Spider Catalog LSIDs and taxonomic family,
    and summarizes the results. Includes caching and checkpoint mechanisms for
    efficient large-scale queries.
Maintainer: Victor Lobato dos Santos <vlobatosantos@gmail.com>
